---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../../site';
const description =
  "Angelo Lima, developer since 2013, now an AI-augmented developer, tech lead and engineering manager. Background, tools and open source projects.";
---
<PageLayout
  lang="en"
  title="About me"
  subtitle="AI-augmented developer, tech lead and engineering manager"
  description={description}
  canonical="/en/aboutme/"
  active="about"
  altUrl="/aboutme/"
  breadcrumb={[{ name: 'Home', url: '/en/' }, { name: 'About me', url: '/en/aboutme/' }]}
  alternates={[
    { hreflang: 'en', href: '/en/aboutme/' },
    { hreflang: 'fr', href: '/aboutme/' },
    { hreflang: 'x-default', href: '/aboutme/' },
  ]}
>
  <h2>Background</h2>
  <p>I am <strong>Angelo Lima</strong>, Franco-Portuguese, and I've been building software since 2013. I started as a fullstack developer at SFEIR, a French IT consultancy, and I'm still there. Along the way, the job changed, and so did I.</p>
  <p>Today I'm a tech lead and engineering manager. I support a team of more than 12 consultants, run technical interviews and teach Angular courses. On client work, I've been the technical lead at InVivo Digital Factory since 2022, on B2B agricultural e-commerce platforms. Among other things, I built a WhatsApp AI assistant that takes farmers' orders, wired to the business microservices through OpenAI function calling.</p>
  <p>And I code with AI agents every day. That's what I mean by an AI-augmented developer: the agent writes a good share of the code, and I keep the design, the review and the responsibility for what ships to production.</p>

  <h2>What I Use 💻</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Languages</strong>: TypeScript, JavaScript, Java, Kotlin, Python, PHP</li>
    <li><strong>Frameworks</strong>: Node.js, Nest.js, Angular, React, Vue.js</li>
    <li><strong>Databases</strong>: PostgreSQL, MySQL, MongoDB</li>
    <li><strong>AI</strong>: Claude Code, OpenAI API (function calling), MCP, agents</li>
    <li><strong>Cloud &amp; DevOps</strong>: Docker, AWS, CI/CD</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>What You'll Find on This Blog 📝</h2>

  <h3>Agentic Development and AI</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>Claude Code day to day: field notes, cheat sheets, workflows</li>
    <li>AI models and tools tested for real (Claude, OpenAI, Ollama, Mistral)</li>
    <li>What AI changes in the development cycle, from ticket to production</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>Software Engineering</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>Architecture, code quality and technical debt</li>
    <li>The frameworks and tools I use on client projects</li>
    <li>Security</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>The Job</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>Team management, hiring and mentoring</li>
    <li>The future of developers in the age of agents</li>
    <li>And now and then, a more personal detour</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Technical Projects</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong><a href="https://lingelo.github.io/fuel-radar/">Fuel Radar</a></strong>: Free fuel price comparison for France, Spain and Portugal, built on official open data (<a href="https://github.com/Lingelo/fuel-radar">source code</a>)</li>
    <li><strong><a href="https://lingelo.github.io/prelude-of-the-chambered-reborn/">Prelude of the Chambered: Reborn</a></strong>: Browser-playable TypeScript port of Notch's dungeon crawler (<a href="/en/prelude-of-the-chambered-reborn-typescript-web-port/">the article</a>)</li>
    <li><strong><a href="https://github.com/Lingelo/sql-assistant">SQL Assistant</a></strong>: Open-source tool to convert natural language to SQL queries</li>
    <li><strong><a href="https://github.com/Lingelo/mcp-atlassian">MCP Atlassian</a></strong>: JIRA/Confluence integration with language models</li>
    <li><strong>PostgreSQL Migration</strong>: Tools and guides for migrating from MySQL to PostgreSQL</li>
  </ul>
  <p>These projects, like this blog, are free, open source and ad-free. If one of them is useful to you, you can support me by <a href={SITE.kofi} rel="noopener" target="_blank" data-kofi="about">buying me a coffee on Ko-fi</a> ☕</p>

  <h2>Contact &amp; Networks 📫</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>GitHub</strong>: <a href="https://github.com/lingelo">Lingelo</a></li>
    <li><strong>LinkedIn</strong>: <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/ang%C3%A9lo-lima/">Angelo Lima</a></li>
    <li><strong>Email</strong>: {SITE.email}</li>
    <li><strong>CV</strong>: <a href="/resume/cv-angelo-lima.html" target="_blank">View online</a> <i class="fa fa-external-link"></i> | <a href="/resume/cv-angelo-lima.pdf" download>Download PDF</a> <i class="fa fa-download"></i></li>
  </ul>

  <p>This platform serves as a space for analysis and technical expertise sharing, focused on the evolution of web technologies and artificial intelligence.</p>
  <p>For any technical discussion or professional collaboration, feel free to contact me through the channels mentioned above.</p>
</PageLayout>
